 our model we can get a reasonably well\u00a0estimate of the average unbiased ratings. We propose and compare several predictive models to estimate unbiased average ratings and show how textual data can play a critical role in enhancing the predictive power. Our results can help review aggregation platforms to determine mechanisms to cut down the bias on their platforms and can benefit businesses and consumers on their platform to access a fairer metric for service quality.","topics":[],"score":225038,"global_rank":191141},{"name":"taimoorrf/wallFollowingRobot","owner":"taimoorrf","html_url":"https://github.com/taimoorrf/wallFollowingRobot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Python based implementation of a wall following robot using the genetic algorithm.","topics":[],"score":225038,"global_rank":191174},{"name":"ethanlshen/NY-Hospital-Charges","owner":"ethanlshen","html_url":"https://github.com/ethanlshen/NY-Hospital-Charges","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Machine learning project for predicting hospital charges for pneumonia, septicemia, and skin infections.","topics":[],"score":225038,"global_rank":191179},{"name":"MeetTheSDE/Object-Detection","owner":"MeetTheSDE","html_url":"https://github.com/MeetTheSDE/Object-Detection","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":225038,"global_rank":191190},{"name":"danenbm/fintech-m13-deep-learning","owner":"danenbm","html_url":"https://github.com/danenbm/fintech-m13-deep-learning","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":225038,"global_rank":191217},{"name":"jalen253/Phase-3-Rough","owner":"jalen253","html_url":"https://github.com/jalen253/Phase-3-Rough","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":225035,"g